Swap support

DebDroid's swap handling (command/swap.sh and the CONFIG_ENV_SWAP options) is an
independent implementation of the mechanism demonstrated by janithcooray's
Lineage OS SWAP mod:
    https://github.com/janithcooray/lin_os_swap_mod

No code from that module is included. It is credited for establishing which
approach works on android, and for its boot sentinel, which DebDroid's boot hook
adopts. See THIRD_PARTY.md for details.

